# Common HTTP Methods

### GET

Used to retrieve data.

Examples:

* Get Products
* Get Users
* Get Weather
* Get News

```python
requests.get(url)
```

---

### POST

Used to send new data.

Examples:

* Login
* Signup
* Upload Image
* Create Order

```python
requests.post(url)
```

---

### PUT

Used to update existing data.

Example:

Update Profile.

```python
requests.put(url)
```

---

### DELETE

Used to delete data.

Example:

Delete User.

```python
requests.delete(url)
```

